# Working rasters and vector exports. Every one of these is anchored on purpose: an
# unanchored `assets/` or `data/` also matched frontend/public/assets and
# frontend/src/data, which silently excluded the React app's whole data layer and
# every image it renders.
/assets/
*.tif
*.tiff
*.shp
*.gpkg
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# probe and run logs
*.log

# One-off Earth Engine probes. Their conclusions are written up in docs/; the payloads
# are a timed-out request and a region listing, not data to publish.
/run_probe.json
/regions_probe.json
/scripts/probe_run_cost.py

# The labelled sample tables (~180 KB) and the trained bundle (~600 KB) are versioned
# deliberately: without them nobody can reproduce the model page from a clone.
